# Mind Drill Assailant: "Threshold — As long as there are seven or more cards in your graveyard, this creature gets +3/+0" (CR 207.2c, 604.1,
# 613.4c). Black Lotus is sacrificed for {B}{B}{B} and Mox Jet's {B} pays the Assailant ({2}{U/B}{U/B}, CR 107.4e). Graveyard count: Black
# Lotus (1); Faithless Looting and the two Islands it discards (4); Thought Scour aimed at Bot2, so it adds only itself (5); a {2}{U/B}
